{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわっふるーと!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日空腹になるのが多くて、困ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきたから、冬眠の準備してるのかな～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬が近づくと食べ物をたべたくなる。( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも寝るより、寝転がってる方がすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日前に見たことある場面を見たんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう言うのなんていうんだっけ。忘れちゃった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近多いかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日いつも通りりしゃにチョコレートあるー?って聞いたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその代わりにチョコクロワッサンくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。(。-∀-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま、髪を切りたい病にかかってます。どうしよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFXSSH4V825VH6Y810MHFNX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}